WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Your reps had a great call. Fourteen minutes in, the customer said, we're also looking at Gong.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Gauge is an AI notetaker for your sales calls.
Your reps just talk — they drop in the MP3, hit record, or capture Google Meet. No bot ever joins.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Gauge does the rest: a clean summary, who does what by when, and a draft follow-up.

00:28.000 --> 00:39.000
The second a rival is named, you get the exact line —
who said it, on which call — as a Slack ping. You never get blindsided again.
